"machine is being launched (rocket icon in the status field). We can "
"double click on la instancia in the list to move to la instancia detail "
"page. For now we will see a progress bar indicating that la instancia is "
"being created y is starting up. The exact amount of time this process "
"will take depends selections made when provisioning la instancia. For "
"more detailed information on the status of various provisioning "
"processes, we can scroll down y select the \"HISTORY\" tab. The "
"\"STATUS\" icon will change desde the blue rocket to a green play button "
"when la instancia is fully ready. Además, we can click on the hyperlinked"
" dirección IP in the \"VMS\" section of this page to view a "
"predeterminado page in a web browser to confirm success."

